# Source constraint for canfar-lab, consumed by `make lock-astroai-lab`.
#
# Unpinned on purpose. The lock pins transitive dependencies for lock-check.
# Image builds install that lock, then reinstall canfar-lab from this git URL
# so the package tracks the default branch at build time. Never edit the
# lockfile by hand.
#
# Tracks astroai/canfar-lab main (unpinned).
canfar-lab @ git+https://github.com/astroai/canfar-lab.git
